{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "11ac6101-e4b9-87bb-ae26-a75ff15d0e82",
  "created_at": "2025-12-16T11:59:15-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Finance",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Raj Patel",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Luis Barros",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-16T11:57:26-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Finance department, this is Luis. Looks like you caught me right before lunch, so we'll make this a good one."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-16T11:57:32-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, yes, my name is Raj Patel. I got a parking ticket and I want to dispute it. Can you hear me okay? I have bad signal."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-16T11:57:40-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "A little choppy but I've got you. What's the ticket for?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-16T11:57:44-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "They wrote that I was too close to a hydrant. But I was not that close. I know the distance, I measured it after, it was [inaudible] more than they say."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-16T11:57:53-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Do you have the ticket in front of you? I'll need the ticket number off the top."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-16T11:57:58-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, hold on. [pause] Um, [line breaks up] sorry, it is, wait. Ma, anda buska kaneta, kaneta di bo. No, na mesa. Sorry, my mother is helping me find the pen."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-16T11:58:07-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No problem, take your time. I'm not going anywhere, that's the benefit of this job."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-16T11:58:12-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, I have it. But the number is long, can I just ask first how long does the appeal take? Because I do not know if I should wait to pay."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-16T11:58:21-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Generally it takes a few weeks to get a decision, depending on how backed up they are. Once you file it, the ticket is usually on hold while it's reviewed. You'll want to file it in writing with your photos and the measurement."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-16T11:58:32-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "A few weeks, okay. And where do I file it? Because on the website there is a pop-up window that keeps appearing and I cannot close it. I press the X and it comes back again."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-16T11:58:42-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's a popular one. Try closing the whole browser and reopening it, or use your phone instead of the computer. If it still fights you, I can mail you the appeal form."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-16T11:58:51-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, mail is fine. Please send it. My number is [line breaks up] four zero one, five five five, zero one seven one."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-16T11:58:58-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I've got four oh one, five five five, zero one seven one. I'll note it. And the mailing address, I'll need that from you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-16T11:59:05-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sorry, you are breaking up. I will call back with the ticket number and the mailing address from a better place."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-16T11:59:11-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sounds good. Call back any time and ask for Luis. Have a good one."
    }
  ],
